  (text "5.1k Rd on each CC pin: sink only. No PD negotiation, no 9 V request.\nApple 20 W adapter uses 5 V through a standards-compliant USB-C cable.\n100mA hardware input limit: 5 V x 0.1 A = 0.50 W nominal input budget.\nInput guard U14 is independent of MCU: see sheet08. Analog timing/thermal protection not yet qualified."
    (at 205 270 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "96ef405a-38a9-5821-bcca-eaa17f52606c")
  )
